# Fuzzer corpora and seeds are opaque inputs: rewriting a CR byte changes the
# input and silently invalidates crash reproduction. node/.gitattributes sets
# "* text=auto" higher in the tree, and a deeper .gitattributes wins regardless
# of pattern specificity, so the exemption has to live here.
#
# "-text" only disables line-ending conversion; git still detects real binaries
# for diff and merge by looking for NUL bytes.
* -text

# The drivers and this README are ordinary source.
*.go text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
